   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Award by line to V2, V5 and V1. Total ₹1.19 Cr, ₹5.0 L below the cheapest single vendor.\n\nShow working ▴\nData used: 30 lines × 5 vendors, normalized values\nFilter: questionnaire rules locked Day 0 → V3 (score 58%) and V4 (ISO expired) left out\nRule: for each line, lowest ₹ per piece delivered among V1, V2, V5\nFormula: Σ (Plant 1 qty + Plant 2 qty) × chosen price\n[ Saved as scenario ① ✓ ]",
   "originalText": "Award by line to V2, V5 and V1. Total ₹1.19 Cr, ₹5.0 L below the cheapest single vendor.\n\nShow working ▴\nData used: 30 lines × 5 vendors, normalized values\nFilter: questionnaire rules locked Day 0 → V3 (score 58%) and V4 (ISO expired) left out\nRule: for each line, lowest ₹ per piece delivered among V1, V2, V5\nFormula: Σ (Plant 1 qty + Plant 2 qty) × chosen price\n[ Saved as scenario ① ✓ ]",
